                            <h2>Why PMP Certification Matters in Today's Project Management Landscape</h2>
                            <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-10">The <a href="https://pdu-edu.org/">Project Management Professional</a> (PMP®) certification is one of the most recognized credentials in the world of project management. It demonstrates not only your knowledge of project management frameworks but also your ability to lead, deliver, and drive business outcomes across industries.</p>
