                            <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-10">Holding a PMP certification positions you as a highly skilled project management professional. Organizations across technology, healthcare, finance, and construction prefer certified managers because they bring proven expertise. With PMP credentials, professionals unlock opportunities for career advancement, higher salaries, and international recognition.</p>
                            <h2>Competitive Edge in Project Management Roles</h2>
