                            <h2>Understanding the Complexity of the PMP Exam Format</h2>
                            <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-10">The PMP exam consists of <a href="https://pdu-edu.org/">180 multiple-choice questions</a> that test your knowledge across domains such as process, people, and business environment. Candidates often find it challenging to adapt to the exam’s situational and analytical style of questioning.</p>
                            <h2>Common Mistakes Candidates Make During Preparation</h2>
                            <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-10">•	Over-reliance on theory without practice</p>
                            <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-10">•	Poor time management during study sessions</p>
